            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A 35 year old female presented with a pruritic plague on the dorsum of the left forearm. During follow-up it came to light that the lesion self-inflicted and served as a means to seek help for the underlying psycho-social problem in the patient's life.</AbstractText>
